<section class="space-y-6">
  <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--ink2)]">Job Search is available in three usage modes. Only the hosted mode involves a payment to this service.</p>

  <section class="space-y-4">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <article class="jh-card p-5 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[color:var(--ink)]">Use internal credits</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">Use the hosted service. You ask me for a prepaid credit balance; credits are consumed as the service runs.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">
          <li>Credits cover source API costs, AI scoring, deduplication, and email delivery costs.</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/welcome" class="mt-auto jh-btn-primary">Get started</a>
      </article>

      <article class="jh-card p-5 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[color:var(--ink)]">Bring your own keys</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">Use the app at no charge by connecting your own provider API keys.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">
          <li>No credit purchase required.</li>
          <li>You are billed directly by your providers (OpenAI, Apify, etc.).</li>
          <li>No service fee from Job Search.</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/welcome" class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-[11px] text-sm font-semibold transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--accent-border)]" style="background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent);border:1px solid var(--accent-border)">Get started</a>
      </article>

      <article class="jh-card p-5 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[color:var(--ink)]">Self-hosted</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">Run the open-source code from GitHub for personal, non-commercial use.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">
          <li>No charge from this service.</li>
          <li>You manage your own infrastructure, security, and provider keys.</li>
          <li>Commercial use is not permitted under this mode.</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://github.com/girshovich/linkedin-job-hunter" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-[11px] text-sm font-semibold jh-btn-secondary">View on GitHub</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[color:var(--ink)]">Credits</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--ink2)]">Credits are a prepaid usage balance tied to your account. They have no cash value, are non-transferable, and cannot be shared between accounts. Credits are consumed when provider costs are incurred — when a job run executes, AI scoring happens, or emails are sent — regardless of the quality of results.</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--ink2)]">Cost varies by the number and type of job sources used, roles and locations scored, AI model selected, and volume of matching jobs on the market. First use over a longer period fetches more results than daily updates, so costs more.</p>

    <h3 class="text-sm font-medium text-[color:var(--ink)] pt-1">Credit packages</h3>
    <div class="jh-card divide-y divide-[color:var(--line)] overflow-hidden text-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center px-4 py-3">
        <span class="font-bold text-[color:var(--ink)] w-28 shrink-0">2 credits</span>
        <span class="text-[color:var(--faintest)] w-8 shrink-0 text-center">=</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-[color:var(--ink)] w-16 shrink-0 pr-4">$4</span>
        <span class="text-[color:var(--ink2)] flex-1">To start and try</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center px-4 py-3">
        <span class="font-bold text-[color:var(--ink)] w-28 shrink-0">5 credits</span>
        <span class="text-[color:var(--faintest)] w-8 shrink-0 text-center">=</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-[color:var(--ink)] w-16 shrink-0 pr-4">$8</span>
        <span class="text-[color:var(--ink2)] flex-1">~80% source coverage, a couple of roles across 3–5 countries</span>
        <span class="ml-4 shrink-0 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-xs font-medium" style="background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green2)">save $2</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center px-4 py-3">
        <span class="font-bold text-[color:var(--ink)] w-28 shrink-0">10 credits</span>
        <span class="text-[color:var(--faintest)] w-8 shrink-0 text-center">=</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-[color:var(--ink)] w-16 shrink-0 pr-4">$15</span>
        <span class="text-[color:var(--ink2)] flex-1">Every source, a couple of roles across 3–5 countries</span>
        <span class="ml-4 shrink-0 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-xs font-medium" style="background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green2)">save $5</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center px-4 py-3">
        <span class="font-bold text-[color:var(--ink)] w-28 shrink-0">20 credits</span>
        <span class="text-[color:var(--faintest)] w-8 shrink-0 text-center">=</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-[color:var(--ink)] w-16 shrink-0 pr-4">$29</span>
        <span class="text-[color:var(--ink2)] flex-1">Best value for power users</span>
        <span class="ml-4 shrink-0 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-xs font-medium" style="background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green2)">save $11</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-[color:var(--faint)]">Coverage estimates are indicative. Credits are not refundable, and are forfeited if your account is closed or terminated for cause.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[color:var(--ink)]">Billing and payment</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--ink2)]">Credits are sold by Mikhail Girshovich. Payments are processed by <strong>Hipolink</strong>, which handles checkout, payment processing, and receipts.</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--ink2)] mt-1">Checkout takes place on Hipolink's secure payment page. You do not enter card details into Job Search. Hipolink's <a href="https://hipolink.net/en/app/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[color:var(--accent)] hover:underline">privacy policy</a> applies to the payment data you provide there.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[color:var(--ink)]">Availability</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--ink2)]">Hosted credit purchasing is planned and not yet available. These terms will apply once the feature launches.</p>
  </section>
</section>
